            "review_title": "Review at Noi Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Celia D\nDi An, Vietnam3 contributions\n1\nVery good european cuisine\nJan 2019 • Family\nWe decided to try out this restaurant after having read the reviews.\nThe atmosphere was relaxed, not fancy.\nWe ordered the cucumber salad (super good but at 85,000 is also super pricey), a cassolette au chorizo (a little spicy with a taste of couscous), a seared sea bass with ratatouille all very tasty. My 5 yo son took a linguine a la carbonara also very tasty and the bacon tastes like home made. The tree main courses were priced from 140,000 to 175,000 and all are reasonable serving size. \nWe will come back to try the escargots de Bourgogne.\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2019",
